# Implementation Plan - Spring Boot REST API (Practical 1 Baseline)

Refactor and upgrade the existing `rest-demo` Spring Boot REST API codebase to a clean, production-minded, modern industry-standard implementation suitable as the reference solution for Practical 1.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Spring Boot Version**: Updating Spring Boot starter parent to `3.4.3` (stable 3.x release) for modern Jakarta EE and Bean Validation standard support.
> - **API Endpoints**: Migrating endpoints from `/employee/{email}` to standard REST resource endpoints under `/api/employees` and adding `GET /api/hello`.
> - **Database Profile**: Adding `h2` database runtime dependency to enable seamless out-of-the-box in-memory execution and automated testing without requiring a pre-running local MySQL server, while retaining full externalized MySQL configuration support in `application.properties`.

